{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幻住乃大夫門舘，亦老祖\n故人也，見帖中。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無位真人赤骨律辭\n世頌語"}
